<title>UK: Associates Corp of North America plans FRN.</title>
<headline>Associates Corp of North America plans FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associates Corporation of North America has mandated J.P. Morgan and Morgan Stanley as joint bookrunners for a Euro-Asian FRN, Morgan Stanley said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The issue size is expected to be $500 million and at a five-year maturity. Associates Corp is rated AA3 by Moody's Investors Service and AA- by Standard &amp; Poor's, Morgan Stanley said.</p>
<p>Launch is expected later this week.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
